# A minimal govulncheck DB reporting two advisories: GO-2026-5024, the integer
# overflow in golang.org/x/sys/windows fixed in v0.44.0, whose one affected
# import is a Windows one as it is in the published advisory; and GO-2021-0113,
# the golang.org/x/text/language.Parse vuln fixed in v0.3.7, which every
# operating system's scan reaches.
